            <span class="eyebrow reveal">Booster Auth · Identity and access platform</span>
            <h1 class="reveal" style="--d:.08s">Sign-in, users and permissions for all your apps, <span style="color:#7fe0d2">in one place</span>.</h1>
            <p class="lead reveal" style="--d:.16s">Booster Auth runs an OpenID Connect identity provider, user pools and relationship-based authorization
