<div class="logos-strip">
    <div class="wrap">
        <span>OpenID Connect</span><span>OAuth 2.0 + PKCE</span><span>OpenFGA (ReBAC)</span><span>SAML</span><span>Docker Compose</span><span>PostgreSQL</span>
